<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94802" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκηπτός</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκήπτω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thunderbolt</i> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκηπτοὶ [λέγονται τῶν κεραυνῶν] ὅσοι
					κατασκήπτουσιν εἰς τὴν γῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mu.</u>
					395a28
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				3.1.11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάρβος . . ὡς ἀπὸ ς</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				1.6
			</span></i>: metaph. also of a dust-<i>storm</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				418
			</span></i>; <i>hurricane</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.194
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1.35b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοιμοῦ ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				715
			</span></i> (troch.); of war, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				1046
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.</u>
				674
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλοῦσί μ᾽ οἱ νεώτεροι . .
				σκηπτόν</span>, says a parasite, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				195.11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. πόθος</span>
			<i>falling like a thunderbolt</i>, Aspasia ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				5.219e
			</span></i>.</div>
